            <td>Dart only</td>
            <td>JavaScript / TypeScript only</td>
            <td>Kotlin only</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Desktop &amp; Windows</th>
            <td class="col-osprey"><span class="cell-chip">&#10003; First-Class OS</span><br>Genuine SwiftUI (macOS), genuine WinUI MSIX (Windows), or Custom Canvas</td>
            <td>Custom canvas inside Win32 / macOS shell</td>
            <td>Community-maintained Windows &amp; macOS forks</td>
            <td>Skia drawn inside a JVM / Swing desktop window</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Accessibility &amp; AI agents</th>
